{"card_hash": "7d9049170278f157198eb98a1fc5e231cc57f31961b9332c0b12c9e4ae382903", "channel": "Linas Beliūnas", "chars": 50762, "chars_all_clips": 50762, "chars_chosen_clips": 1440, "clip_count": 34, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=0", "end": 119.349, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "aadcb8a85d60faef991b7898b3863376fda0804d927594cfbe78622ff16c1521", "start": 0.0, "text": "And I'm going to talk to you about what's happening in AI. A little huge notice, but it is a thing these days and we have many people at Google working on this area so presenting the work of not just my work with many, many people like Goog", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=1073", "end": 1193.839, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "8e833afa69329c7b70f15655855c5a784a9de9db8c67266a74b81bf2233a5e36", "start": 1073.97, "text": "That State Being Ready Before You Can Go On To Update The Next Word So It's Not Very Parallelizable Which Isn't Good In Modern Hardware And The Other Thing Is You Are Trying To Force All Of Things That Went Through Into A Single Vector So I", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=1910", "end": 2030.289, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "9ba104e4d292a7d220bb3a198d4d26bba44063e2fe462e61b6619dcf77544aa1", "start": 1910.68, "text": "What That Teacher Model Can Give The Word That Likely Next Words So It Could Be Violin Can You Piano Could Be Trumpet Is Almost Certainly Not Airplane Unless There's New Concerto They Don't Know About And To That Give A Really Rich Gradient", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=2268", "end": 2388.039, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "adc3105012ed44d1e1078df40ad4e3254221fd8e922b7cb4ccbaf2bbc8f39a26", "start": 2268.8, "text": "The Question Mark It Can Probably Make A Prediction Of Four Or Five Tokens And Get Some Of Them Correct In Particular Some Prefix Of Them Correct So You Have A Fast Draft Model Where You Don't Need The Full Sophistication Of Much Larger Mod", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=3103", "end": 3222.199, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "6f64635e3bb85ffeea9ebaf4d770b119d89e2df2720556cc7715f4b21c5c5467", "start": 3103.42, "text": "Planet Not Demoted Dwarf And He Said Perfect We Are So Back Okay I Want To Touch A Little Bit On How We Organize A Big Effort Like Gemini In Particular This Is A Large Effort Now Co-author Of The Paper With More Than 1000 Authors Our Report", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=3342", "end": 3460.96, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "ff71f69651b0a58b6d58245195d87677b999d22b544439cf7e47943363bbaf55", "start": 3342.059, "text": "Important How Do Humans And Agents Collaborate To Get Stuff Done Right Like Currently A Lot Of The Uses Are You A Single Person Sitting Down With An Interactive Chatbot Interface Doing Stuff But In The Future It Seems Like More Work Is Goin", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/2086168410736546189#t=0", "end": 119.349, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "aadcb8a85d60faef991b7898b3863376fda0804d927594cfbe78622ff16c1521", "start": 0.0, "text": "And I'm going to talk to you about what's happening in AI. A little huge notice, but it is a thing these days and we have many people at Google working on this area so presenting the work of not just my work with many, many people like Goog", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/linasbeliunas/status/208616841073654