{"card_hash": "40786eba9594caba0ce163d09223ae7df8b9a8ffe6b7aaf2a79511d78f72ca7a", "channel": "Codez", "chars": 59127, "chars_all_clips": 59127, "chars_chosen_clips": 1440, "clip_count": 61, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=0", "end": 119.79, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4aca5d7410434edf756e1362574e752af7293c45a74cb3346c0cc42c414a03b6", "start": 0.0, "text": "Welcome to this NeurIPS tutorial on application development using LLMs. Both EASET OpenAI as well Deep Learning AI Fund have had the privilege of working with many people building large language model applications and so we hope To share so", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=1612", "end": 1732.559, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e98e76fb8e7da89dcb4b8f8e2cea67c464ab23a8f9b8f320d369b1dac43c96e0", "start": 1612.599, "text": "JUST PRETENDING EVAN FROM SAN FRANCISCO AND THEN YOU SEE IN THIS CASE THE MODEL KNOWS THIS IS FROM REAL PERSON AND DON'T WANT TO BE TALKED USE A MESSAGE FOR THE ACTUAL IMPORT OF THE TASK. SO THAT WAS THE CHAT FORMAT OF ASSISTANT MODEL NEXT ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=2402", "end": 2521.21, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "a9d39f15efa99b5758f3fe8ca2611a194e0e425c35486ba00c772a06588563e4", "start": 2402.559, "text": "PUT PARTS OF THE OUTPUT INTO A STRUCTURED FORMAT THAT MAKES PASSING IT OUT AFTER MORE SIMPLE SO SORRY THIS IS LONG SYSTEM MESSAGE WE'RE ASKING THE SAME STEPS FIRST THEN COMPARE SOLUTION TO THE STUDENT SOLUTION AND THEN IF THEY MADE A MISTAK", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=4118", "end": 4238.25, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "8fa60b77ac41ff9d32b6608ec51f5ab8a5f08f380205d048c97eb32c91183f7e", "start": 4118.319, "text": "IF YOU WANT YOUR LLM CERTAIN BODY OF INFORMATION TRY RAC FIRST MAYBE A RULE I THINK FIND TURNING IS BETWEEN 10 TO 100X MORE WORK THAN FINE TUNING. ONLY IF YOU SURE TO GO FOR IT AND THEN IT CAN BE VERY POWERFUL. LAST I WANT TO COVER IS A PRA", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=4360", "end": 4480.14, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "20a427b2703652b606c40f9d58e59602f6804f12d0f5948497975b2c9edea53c", "start": 4360.689, "text": "IT TURNS OUT THAT PATIENT INTAKE MAYBE EASIER THAN EVEN READING X-RAYS AND THERE'S OFTEN NOT THE FIRST PICTURE THAT POPS IN YOUR HEAD WHICH IS ACTUALLY THE BEST AUTOMATION OPPORTUNITY WHAT DO LAWYERS DO A MENTAL PICTURE FROM TV AS LAWYERS S", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=5852", "end": 5971.76, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "fa277ae1112ded9b5ce8d3690d3c60973254230e2f68cbdc224ffa35b7d172fe", "start": 5852.079, "text": "LASTLY, I THINK THERE IS A GOLDEN AGING OF AI APPLICATION BUILDING SO YOU TAKE RESPONSE SERIOUSLY BUT EVEN AS THEY KEEP ON EVOLVING WE WILL LEARN ABOUT IT AND GO OUT TO BUILD STUFF FOR OTHERS IF YOUR FIRST PROJECTS DON'T WORK OUT OR HARM OT", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "Developer Marketing", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=0", "end": 119.79, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "4aca5d7410434edf756e1362574e752af7293c45a74cb3346c0cc42c414a03b6", "start": 0.0, "text": "Welcome to this NeurIPS tutorial on application development using LLMs. Both EASET OpenAI as well Deep Learning AI Fund have had the privilege of working with many people building large language model applications and so we hope To share so", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://x.com/0xCodez/status/2086123800765096116#t=1612", "end": 1732.559, "evidence_kind":